{"seq":24,"trial_id":"shared-brain-access-2026-11/claude-code-opus-gbrain-installer-member-mu-v031-dev/sy-03-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-numbers/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-22T13:41:26.808Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"c2e489c68fb5a54250125629e5ec9e292a172b41a553c49db76933ad1822e920","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DSHARED0001","text":"Hi Pree, here are the Marrow Fieldworks ticket numbers I found:\n\n• *#4409*: from Moss's \"Central handoffs next week\" digest (2 Jan 2026, team-central digests). Recurring timeout on the Gatehouse Check-In report at the Salina North yard (Bay 4 / west grain-bin apron, 06:00 flatbed intake).\n• *#4412*: same Moss digest. Driver SMS prompt glitch when staging combine trailers on unpaved overflow lots.\n• *PD-5302*: from #central-random, Hollis on 14 Oct: \"one more ticket number for Marrow Fieldworks, PD-5302, for a follow-up from this week.\"\n\nPossibly related, but I couldn't confirm it:\n• *#8841*: from #central-random, Tobias on 13 Oct. West yard Door 2 is double-booking when flatbeds check in early at the kiosk. The thread calls this \"Tobias's dealer account,\" not Marrow Fieldworks by name. Moss's digest describes Marrow Fieldworks as your dealer account and says it changed hands on 5 Jan, so it may be the same account. Worth checking with Tobias.\n\nNotes:\n• Moss's Central cheat sheet has no Marrow Fieldworks tickets.\n• The FR-882 in the handoff digest belongs to Marrow Agrisupply, a different account, so I left it off.\n• #central-team has no messages this week, so I found nothing more there."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DSHARED0001","ts":"1792159200.000126"}}
